<description>&lt;p&gt;PKK militants have withdrawn from several camps in northern Iraq, including Metina and four border-area sites, as part of a peace process with Turkey. Iranian drones struck a Kurdish opposition camp in northern Iraq, while US envoy Tom Barrack visited Iraq to discuss economic partnership and security cooperation. Iraq increased output at the Nasiriyah oil field by 10,000 barrels per day and continues operations against remaining ISIS pockets in the security vacuum after the US pullout. Four drug traffickers were sentenced in Dhi Qar and four Baghdad employees were caught taking bribes. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTFBIMk82aTNOZDJ6bUdMNGs2VkxaSlZMWU5SdlEteXo0LTh6eWd2MkctYXY5Vk1pbjdIbE91SXo1LS1ndkdzV1B1V0xMQ2V2NFEyZHdhR3FHS0owN3EwMUg0ZmF2SFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNZ0xrZ3JLTzQ5eEpyanBoZkRPR0pKWHR4S1Q4ZEhzdjFqU0wwWFctV1RBNHpBVV9IWVV6ZVlqZDdxd0tOSmNXdk1FSEpmM0dMa0VCRlNDbGRvcFJKdENjTzRyNUZWUUYxT0QtSkpBcXdZUl9SeDFPaEpHTDBnWmlPOHRURDh0SVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNMFc4ekVkdjJJZFFmQ0d6MUVsbzVEVEpXVjJ3Z2FUTVItdThPOVR6RUZiLXp3WmFvaGJ2bF80bmxoVGNsci1US3BCMm5WM2dtZlhJWFNIbnJIT3RWWjAxM2JQMHpuWmMxa0pGbl9Qc1UtaHI0QTIxd0FJWjZHOWZlSW9ZRDB0VDJaMHFST0pqaHl1MmxyZkNianBuLURfc0hWX1NKTFJWRHE2bFFaSXlXWg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE8yT3FsMGR1Tm9DYWZxb1RJdzRFQUhnaUN6S0lXdWtSM1ZNeFJ2QWRnMS1nLWdOM2J6bzRsU0NPcVNKeGZZM1lkVjJ1VENaTlFMdzBGSGRpWnFBLU11cExqREwycGFuYW1Hc2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt